{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In Retail Simulator, you start out with a small plot, pocket change, and a dream. Slowly gain revenue by selling a wide range of categorized products, from a Teddy Bear to a Gaming Keyboard!\u00a0Expand your store, hire employees, level up and become the biggest retail store of all!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3203280/extras/Build_Mode.png?t=1749096745\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enter build mode with a top-down view, precision place shelves and racks or use grid mode. Place walls, windows, lights, and sliding doors to your liking. Build a custom floor layout that suites your needs.\u00a0<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3203280/extras/buildtimelapse.gif?t=1749096745\" /></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3203280/extras/Online_CoOp_V4.png?t=1749096745\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Developed with friends in mind, you can build, manage, and thrive with yourself and up to 3 other people. Use Steam overlay to invite or join.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3203280/extras/friendsgif.gif?t=1749096745\" /></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3203280/extras/Manage_Inventory.png?t=1749096745\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Add products to your shopping cart via the mobile tablet, place an order and await the delivery truck! Make sure storage racks are assigned so restockers can move inventory around.<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3203280/extras/INVENTORYMANAGEMENTGif.gif?t=1749096745\" /></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3203280/extras/Desc_Texts-05.png?t=1749096745\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Assign products to shelves by restocking with a product box. Click the tag and set your price! Be mindful that Customers will not buy overpriced items.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3203280/extras/teddygif.gif?t=1749096745\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3203280?t=1749096745","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3203280/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1749096745","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3203280/5b4ceb6b41a8d980bb78d4d928c77ede508ced0d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749096745","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3203280/5b4ceb6b41a8d980bb78d4d928c77ede508ced0d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749096745","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In Retail Simulator, you start out with a small plot, pocket change, and a dream. Slowly gain revenue by selling a wide range of categorized products, from a Teddy Bear to a Gaming Keyboard!\u00a0Expand your store, hire employees, level up and become the biggest retail store of all!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3203280/extras/Build_Mode.png?t=1749096745\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enter build mode with a top-down view, precision place shelves and racks or use grid mode. Place walls, windows, lights, and sliding doors to your liking. Build a custom floor layout that suites your needs.\u00a0<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3203280/extras/buildtimelapse.gif?t=1749096745\" /></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3203280/extras/Online_CoOp_V4.png?t=1749096745\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Developed with friends in mind, you can build, manage, and thrive with yourself and up to 3 other people. Use Steam overlay to invite or join.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3203280/extras/friendsgif.gif?t=1749096745\" /></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3203280/extras/Manage_Inventory.png?t=1749096745\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Add products to your shopping cart via the mobile tablet, place an order and await the delivery truck! Make sure storage racks are assigned so restockers can move inventory around.<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3203280/extras/INVENTORYMANAGEMENTGif.gif?t=1749096745\" /></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3203280/extras/Desc_Texts-05.png?t=1749096745\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Assign products to shelves by restocking with a product box. Click the tag and set your price! Be mindful that Customers will not buy overpriced items.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3203280/extras/teddygif.gif?t=1749096745\" /></p>","developers":["Delarocky"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3203280/740b5d52f2a2048f0bdd8bb11af21a7b4b904b22/header.jpg?t=1749096745","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Retail Simulator","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows (64-bit) 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7-4790K or AMD Ryzen 5 1500X<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1050 Ti or AMD Radeon RX 470<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 10<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows (64-bit) 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7-9700K or AMD Ryzen 7 3700X<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce RTX 2060 or AMD Radeon RX 6600XT<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB availab